flowchart TD
  Start([Forgot password]) --> Email[Enter email]
  Email --> Found{Account exists?}
  Found -->|yes| Send[Send reset link]
  Send --> Click[User clicks link]
  Click --> Valid{Link valid?}
  Valid -->|yes| NewPass[Set new password]
  NewPass --> Saved([Password updated])
  Valid -->|no| Expired[Link expired]
  Found -->|no| Generic[Show generic message]

  %% @main Start Email Found Send Click Valid NewPass Saved
  %% @exit Found -> Generic, Valid -> Expired
